<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merck, Warner-Lambert rated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merck, Warner-Lambert rated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said analyst Paul Brook reduced his rating for Merck &amp; Co Inc Wednesday to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- He also reiterated his rating of Warner-Lambert Co as a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in Warner-Lambert closed at 92-3/4 Tuesday. Those of Merck closed at 85-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
